{
  "date": "2026-11-03",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行宣布：股票回购增持再贷款利率降到1%，改为长期安排",
  "title_en": "PBOC announces: relending rate for share buybacks and increases cut to 1%, made a long-term arrangement",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月2日，中国人民银行、金融监管总局和证监会开会，讨论两项工具。一项是证券、基金、保险公司互换便利，另一项是股票回购增持再贷款。",
      "en": "On November 2, the People's Bank of China, the National Financial Regulatory Administration and the CSRC held meetings to discuss two tools. One is the swap facility for securities, fund and insurance companies; the other is the relending facility for share buybacks and increases."
    },
    {
      "zh": "股票回购增持再贷款原来是阶段性的安排，现在改成了长期安排。它的利率也从1.25%降到了1%。央行要求金融机构按照市场原则，在这个利率上加一点利差，再把钱贷给企业。",
      "en": "The relending facility for share buybacks and increases used to be a temporary arrangement; now it has become a long-term one. Its interest rate also fell from 1.25% to 1%. The central bank asked financial institutions to follow market principles, add a small spread on top of this rate, and then lend the money to companies."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这个工具是2024年10月推出的，当时的利率是1.75%。到10月底，已经签订的合同金额约4400亿元，累计放款超过2800亿元。",
      "en": "This tool was launched in October 2024, when the rate was 1.75%. By the end of October, the signed contracts amounted to about 440 billion yuan, and total lending was over 280 billion yuan."
    },
    {
      "zh": "互换便利的第三批操作从11月3日开始，期限是一年，可以延期。已有31家证券公司和基金公司申请，金额超过1000亿元。11月2日，A股普遍上涨，上证指数涨了1.08%。",
      "en": "The third batch of swap facility operations starts on November 3, with a term of one year that can be extended. 31 securities and fund companies have applied, for more than 100 billion yuan. On November 2, A-shares rose broadly, and the Shanghai Composite Index gained 1.08%."
    }
  ],
